 on this circle make an angle <math><msup><mrow><mn>60</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></math> at the center, the equivalent resistance between these two points will be:"}, "options": [{"id": "e509f2", "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></math>", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4ef0c677dc36a88edc2b"}, {"id": "144dc7", "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>12</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></math>", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4ef0c677dc36a88edc2c"}, {"id": "964e35", "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></math>", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4ef0c677dc36a88edc2d"}, {"id": "21de12", "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></math>", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4ef0c677dc36a88edc2e"}], "questionLabels": []}, {"_id": "69de4ef0c677dc36a88edc2f", "type": "singleCorrect", "chapters": ["60ced3330e34b73944ddfade"], "topics": ["60e2fb5766f9ce3f243b4f36"], "concepts": ["6117b9d167dbe2603c3eacab"], "question": {"text": "What is the current through the battery in the circuit shown below\n<img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/quantrexacademy-app.firebasestorage.app/o/questions%2Ffigs%2Fpyq%2Fjee_main%2F5547CWB6ykWlMLJGNbbVtpcPVhUBObIaNs5mvQw7Jto.original.fullsize.png?alt=media\"/><br/>"}, "options": [{"id": "214c4d", "text": "1.5 A", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4ef0c677dc36a88edc30"}, {"id": "51cfa0", "text": "0.5 A", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4ef0c677dc36a88edc31"}, {"id": "83df2b", "text": "0.25 A", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4ef0c677dc36a88edc32"}, {"id": "2680a5", "text": "1.0 A", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4ef0c677dc36a88edc33"}], "questionLabels": []}], "markingScheme": {"_id": "608283e223cf4b